{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Legalise riding gas-powered bicycles & pit bikes under 100cc on public roads",
        "additional_details": "We want the Government to stop punishing low-income commuters and young people, and to give us affordable transport! We feel travel costs are too high. E-bikes provide free travel but can cost thousands to buy. Gas-powered bicycles and pit bikes under 100cc can cost a fraction of the price and match e-bike top speeds, yet current legislation restricts their use.\r\n\r\nLegalising the use of gas-powered bicycles and pit bikes could create transport equality for low-income workers and youth, and unlock affordable, independent travel!",
        "background": "Fully legalise the right to ride gas-powered bicycles and pit bikes under 100cc on public roads and paths. We feel current laws demand costly motorcycle licenses, tax, and insurance\u2014impeding cheap travel.",
